sequenceDiagram
    participant C as OrderController
    participant S as OrderService
    participant R as OrderRepository
    participant O as Order
    participant P as DomainEventPublisher
    participant L as OrderEventsListener
    C->>S: placeOrder(orderId)
    S->>R: findById(orderId)
    R-->>S: order
    S->>O: place()
    Note right of O: comprueba invariantes<br/>registra OrderPlaced
    S->>R: save(order)
    S->>O: pullDomainEvents()
    O-->>S: [OrderPlaced]
    S->>P: publish(events)
    P-)L: OrderPlaced
    Note right of L: "Enviando email..."
